MID_EV20_105_m01: <EDH>
MID_EV20_105_m01_002: It's no use, Troy. We can't hold them off forever.
MID_EV20_105_m01_003: Hold your ground just a little longer. Letting them\npast us will mean certain ruin.
MID_EV20_105_m01_004: I'm well aware. But we have to face reality.
MID_EV20_105_m01_005: Hey! Unless you have a death wish, stay back!
MID_EV20_105_m01_006: 'Tis early for a brazen display of power, but if there\nwere ever a situation for it, 'tis this one.
MID_EV20_105_m01_007: All those here defiled by the darkness of the\nunderworld, begone from my sight!
MID_EV20_105_m01_008: She crushed the entire force in an instant... I've\nnever seen such power.
MID_EV20_105_m01_009: Whoever you are, you saved not just us but the lives\nof everyone in that village.
MID_EV20_105_m01_010: Think nothing of it. I come with a favor to ask the\npair of you.
MID_EV20_105_m01_011: I have traveled far on the understanding that the\npeople here know of the forbidden land.
MID_EV20_105_m01_012: That's true enough. I know a fair amount about it.
MID_EV20_105_m01_013: Really?! What a stroke of luck! I know where it can\nbe found already, mind you.
MID_EV20_105_m01_014: But my pleas there would bear little fruit unless I\nwas accompanied by a trusted chaperone.
MID_EV20_105_m01_015: I urge you to guide me there at once!
MID_EV20_105_m01_016: But the forbidden land—or Kunlun, as we call it—\nhas been abandoned. There's nothing there for you.
MID_EV20_105_m01_017: In fact, almost everything of value was destroyed in\nthe Battle of Fezzan long ago.
MID_EV20_105_m01_018: *sigh*
MID_EV20_105_m01_019: Untrue! Causality and my intuition say otherwise.
MID_EV20_105_m01_020: I know that the forbidden land holds that which\nI seek!
MID_EV20_105_m01_021: This world's salvation has been entrusted to me.
MID_EV20_105_m01_022: And I must deliver it to its destination, come\nwhat may.
MID_EV20_105_m01_023: But I shall require guidance along the way. I cannot\nafford another such display of power.
MID_EV20_105_m01_024: To reach my destination, I'll need your support.\nYour...deliverance.
MID_EV20_105_m01_025: Hm. You've piqued my interest.
MID_EV20_105_m01_026: Troy, you can't be serious.
MID_EV20_105_m01_027: And you're certain that it's the forbidden land you\nneed to get to? Not...the other?
MID_EV20_105_m01_028: Yes. That is where causality pulls me most strongly.\nI must reach it.
MID_EV20_105_m01_029: I take it by the look of you that you're one of the\nDagdan pantheon. What do they call you?
MID_EV20_105_m01_030: This woman is a goddess?!
MID_EV20_105_m01_031: Ah, I did neglect to name myself. I am Fortuna,\nknown also as the Goddess of Fate.
MID_EV20_105_m01_032: So you're Fortuna. Very interesting indeed.\nHong Hua, take her where she needs to go.
MID_EV20_105_m01_033: But...
MID_EV20_105_m01_034: Don't worry about me. I'll manage the defense of\nthis place somehow.
MID_EV20_105_m01_035: You heard the woman. She's got the key to saving\nthe world in her hands.
MID_EV20_105_m01_036: If there's even the smallest chance that's true,\nwe have to take the risk.
MID_EV20_105_m01_037: Very true. You were swift in coming to the correct\nconclusion. Hehehe.
MID_EV20_105_m01_038: Fine, then. Come with me. We'll reach the forbidden\nland together.